From: dianqk <dianqk@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sheng: use the controller Bluetooth address

The device tree must not assign the same Bluetooth address to every tablet.
Leave address selection to the controller firmware or a per-tablet setting.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550-xiaomi-sheng.dts | 2 --
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550-xiaomi-sheng.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550-xiaomi-sheng.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550-xiaomi-sheng.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8550-xiaomi-sheng.dts
@@ -1751,8 +1751,6 @@ &uart14 {
 	bluetooth {
 		compatible = "qcom,wcn7850-bt";
 
-		local-bd-address = [ 24 00 00 00 5a ad ];
-
 		vddrfacmn-supply = <&vreg_pmu_rfa_cmn>;
 		vddaon-supply = <&vreg_pmu_aon_0p59>;
 		vddwlcx-supply = <&vreg_pmu_wlcx_0p8>;
